{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06998","headline":"赠房侍御 · 陶翰","name":"赠房侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志士固不羁，与道常周旋。\n进则天下仰，已之能晏然。\n褐衣东府召，执简南台先。\n雄义每特立，犯颜岂图全。\n谪居东南远，逸气吟芳荃。\n适会寥廓趣，清波更夤缘。\n扁舟入五湖，发缆洞庭前。\n浩荡临海曲，迢遥济江壖。\n徵奇忽忘返，遇兴将弥年。\n乃悟范生智，足明渔父贤。\n郡临新安渚，佳赏此城偏。\n日夕对层岫，云霞映晴川。\n闲居恋秋色，偃卧含贞坚。\n倚伏聊自化，行藏互推迁。\n君其振羽翮，岁晏将冲天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}